      "note": "The simulator used to be infinitely patient, so an agent could leave four seconds of silence on a phone call at no cost. user_plan.impatience makes the caller speak up, and the agent has to say it is still there and resume rather than ignore the question or restart the query. The tool turn declares its latency through _mock_latencies so this stays reproducible instead of depending on how fast the machine running the mock is."
